%% 02-first-deck.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 2 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% Deck anatomy: pages, text lines, directive lines, comments, escaping.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "DarkSlateGray", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Your first deck

deck 2 of 10: anatomy of a .mgp file
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Three kinds of line

	directive lines start with %
		they style what comes after them
	comment lines start with %% or #
		mgp ignores them completely
	every other line is DRAWN, as-is
		a blank line draws as vertical space
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The smallest deck

%size 4, left, fore "gray70"
two lines in a text file:

%size 5, fore "white", prefix "    "
\%page
hello, world

%size 4, fore "gray70", prefix " "
\%page starts a slide; the plain line is its text.
save as hello.mgp, double-click it - that is a deck.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Directives are state

%size 4, left, fore "gray70"
a directive line sets state; text lines then use it:

%size 5, fore "white", prefix "    "
\%size 6, fore "red"
this line is big and red
so is this one

%size 4, fore "gray70", prefix " "
state holds until another directive changes it,
or the next page resets to the deck defaults.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Combining directives

%size 4, left, fore "gray70"
one line may carry several, separated by commas:

%size 5, fore "white", prefix "    "
\%size 5, fore "gold", center

%size 4, fore "gray70", prefix " "
that is exactly how this tutorial styles itself -
press ctrl-r after editing to see changes live.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The preamble

	directives BEFORE the first %page are the preamble
	they set deck-wide machinery:
		%deffont names a font
		%default styles every page's Nth line
		%tab styles bullet levels
	deck 10 returns to these in depth
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Escapes

	to DRAW a literal % at line start, write \\%
	same for a literal # : write \\#
	end a line with a single \\ to continue it
	\\xHH inserts the character with hex code HH
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Try it now

	right-click this deck, Edit
	find this page, change this text
	save, then press ctrl-r here
%pause
%size 4, center, fore "SpringGreen"

if you just did that: you know the core of mgp
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 03-text.mgp
